fragment
→
structure

structure
→
relation

relation
→
observation

observation
→
resolution

Develop unique motion behavior.

Examples may include:

deformation
density changes
partial disappearance
re-emergence
resolution shifts

Do not use generic slide/fade everywhere.

Support reduced-motion.

